abstract: >-
  Analysis code, review checks and a data pack for an independent study of Bangladesh's garment
  exports to the United States (HS chapters 61 and 62, monthly, product level) and the effect of
  the 2025 to 2026 US tariffs, built from public US Census Bureau international trade data.
  05_review/verify.py recomputes 39 headline numbers straight from the raw files.
